title: "Shared low-dimensional structure across diseases in whole-blood transcriptomes: code and data"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Hong
    given-names: Hongzhong
    affiliation: South China University of Technology
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0005-2114-143X"
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-06
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/honghongzhong/cross-disease-whole-blood-transcriptomics"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible analysis and processing code, derived effect tables, reference
  results and figures for a cross-disease whole-blood transcriptomic study.
  The analysis uses 36 training and 12 evaluation comparisons across 12 disease
  categories, with training-selected dimensions for three effect representations.
